              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "möglicherweise — \"maybe, possibly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Möglicherweise ist der Zug schon weg. Maybe the train has already gone."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Built like glücklicherweise: möglich + -erweise. The verb comes right after it."
            }
          ]
        },
