          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "möglicherweise is built from möglich \"possible\", of the family of mögen and Proto-Germanic maganą \"to be able\" (EtymDB), and Weise \"way, manner\"."
            }
          ]
        },
