              "text": "womöglich — \"perhaps even, quite possibly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Der Himmel ist ganz dunkel, womöglich gibt es heute noch ein Gewitter. The sky is very dark; there may even be a thunderstorm today."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Often with a hint of worry: something unwelcome might happen. The verb comes right after it."
            }
          ]
        },
